  "title": "A self is set apart by a definite boundary",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "b812b58d-00af-4eed-bda9-2bb0f68c69bd",
      "text": "A self, or any system that experiences or acts, is set apart from what it is not by a definite boundary. The frameworks that say so define the boundary differently, so the definitions are kept as separate claims.",
